Get a PaymentId from Idempotency Key > OpenAPI definition #/components/parameters/x-idempotency-key

{
 "name": "x-idempotency-key",
 "in": "header",
 "description": "Ensures the LFI processes the resource successfully only once per x-idempotency-key\n\nThe TPP must not change the request body while using the same x-idempotency-key, changes to the request body \nwill not result any action on the end resource. \n\nThe OFP will treat a request as idempotent if it had received the first request with the same x-idempotency-key \nfrom the same TPP in the preceding 24 hours.\n",
 "required": true,
 "schema": {
 "type": "string",
 "maxLength": 40,
 "pattern": "^(\\S*)$"
 },
 "example": "78dae4513b8847f98e2d4173b4ed0eb6"
}

